BoundActionAccepted exercises TryDomainInteraction.
BoundActionAccepted has completeness = closed.
BoundActionAccepted illustrates G4M3UiDomainBinding.
BoundActionAccepted runs-in BoundExecution.
BoundActionAccepted step 1 sends UiActionRequest from FyneBackend to SduiDispatcher via NativeUiActions.
BoundActionAccepted step 2 sends BoundActionRequest from SduiDispatcher to SdlUiBindingAdapter via UiDomainActions.
BoundActionAccepted step 3 sends SdlActionRequest from SdlUiBindingAdapter to SdlDispatcher via SdlActionCalls.
BoundActionAccepted step 4 sends DomainActionRequest from SdlDispatcher to GoDomainImplementation via GoDomainCalls.
BoundActionAccepted step 5 sends DomainActionResult from GoDomainImplementation to SdlDispatcher via GoDomainCalls reply-to 4.
BoundActionAccepted step 6 sends SdlActionResult from SdlDispatcher to SdlUiBindingAdapter via SdlActionCalls reply-to 3.
BoundActionAccepted step 7 sends BoundActionResult from SdlUiBindingAdapter to SduiDispatcher via UiDomainActions reply-to 2.
BoundActionAccepted step 8 sends UiActionResult from SduiDispatcher to FyneBackend via NativeUiActions reply-to 1.
BoundActionAccepted step 9 sends UiGenerationNotices variant UiGenerationChanged from SduiInstanceStore to FyneBackend via UiGenerationEvents.
BoundActionRejected exercises TryDomainInteraction.
BoundActionRejected has completeness = closed.
BoundActionRejected illustrates G4M3UiDomainBinding.
BoundActionRejected runs-in BoundExecution.
BoundActionRejected step 1 sends UiActionRequest from FyneBackend to SduiDispatcher via NativeUiActions.
BoundActionRejected step 2 sends UiActionRejected from SduiDispatcher to FyneBackend via NativeUiActions reply-to 1.
